<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Daily Mail buys radio stations.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Daily Mail buys radio stations.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Daily Mail and General Trust Plc said on Tuesday its Australian unit, DMG Radio Australia, has agreed to buy Broadcast Media, a privately-held company owning 12 regional radio stations in Australia.</p>
</text>
